7. Find Factorial of 10 
    
    ```java
    Integer factorial = IntStream
    .rangeClosed(1,10)
    .reduce(1, (x,y) -> x * y);
    ```
    
8. Sort Strings in decreasing order
    
    ```java
    String[] strArray = {"python", "unit", "test", "javascript"};
    //output -> [javascript, python, unit, test]
    
    String[] output = Arrays.stream(strArray).sorted(Comparator.comparing(String::length).reversed()).toArray(String[]::new);
    
    ```
    
9. Largest Number Formed 
    
    ```java
    List<Integer> integerList = Arrays.asList(9, 5, 30, 3, 4); //9,5,4,3,30 = 954330
    
    integerList.stream()
    .sorted((a,b) -> (String.valueOf(b) + a).compareTo(String.valueOf(a) + b))
    .map(String::valueOf)
    .collect(Collectors.joining());
    ```
    
10. Check palindrome 
    
    ```java
    String str = "abcba"
    // All Match
    boolean isPalindrom = IntStream.range(0, str.length/2)
    .allMatch(i -> str.charAt(i) == str.charAt(str.length - 1 - i))
    
    // Non Match
    boolean isPalindrom = IntStream.range(0, str.length/2)
    .nonMatch(i -> str.charAt(i) != str.charAt(str.length - 1 - i))
    ```
    
11. Reverse Each Word of String Array
    
    ```java
    String[] strArray = {"test", "bench"};
    String[] outArray = Arrays.stream(strArray)
    .map(s -> new StringBuilder(s).reverse())
    .map(StringBuilder::toString)
    .toArray(String[]::new);
    ```
    
12. Reverse an Integer Array
    
    ```java
    int[] intArray = {5, 7, 1, 4, 9};
    Integer[] intArray = IntStream.rangeClosed(0, intArray.length-1)
    .map(i -> intArray[intArray.length-i-1])
    .toArray(Integer[]::new);
    
    ```

  
