31. Find 3rd Max from list of integers
```
List<Integer> numbers = Arrays.asList(4, 1, 7, 3, 9, 2, 7, 9); // example list with duplicates

        Optional<Integer> thirdMax = numbers.stream()
            .distinct()                      // Remove duplicates
            .sorted((a, b) -> b - a)         // Sort in descending order
            .skip(2)                         // Skip first two max values
            .findFirst();                    // Get the third max

        thirdMax.ifPresentOrElse(
            value -> System.out.println("3rd max is: " + value),
            () -> System.out.println("Less than 3 unique elements")
        );
```



  
